{"id":"casualidad","lemma":"casualidad","pos":"noun","rank":1649,"glosses":["chance, coincidence, happenstance, fluke, accident"],"ipa":"/kaswaliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"casualidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-casualidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tú no hablas francés por casualidad, verdad?","en":"You don't speak French by any chance, do you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516345","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"speech","l":"habla"},{"g":"French"},{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"Me la encontré por casualidad.","en":"I met her by chance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37297","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Por alguna de esas casualidades, ¿tiene una aspirina?","en":"Do you by any chance have some aspirin?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594323","words":[{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"aspirin"}]},{"text":"Nos encontramos con ella por casualidad.","en":"We met her by accident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459760","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Nos encontramos por casualidad en la estación.","en":"We happened to meet at the station.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801927","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"station"}]}]}